    intro="KR8TIV designs and sets up online stores for businesses in Edmonton, across Alberta and Canada, from dropship stores to full brands. Ecommerce store setup starts from $1,500 CAD, and you work directly with Matt Haynes on the store, the product pages and the route to checkout."
